    {
      "id": 8777575252950897,
      "plugin": "StochasticTelegraph",
      "model": "Fermata",
      "version": "2.0.21",
      "params": [],
      "rightModuleId": 1848695235950080,
      "data": {
        "text": "EXPLICAT\n\nC - 0.980 - 0.000 - 0.020\nG - 0.565 - 0.585 - 0.605\nD - 0.150 - 0.170 - 0.190\nA - 0.735 - 0.755 - 0.775\nE - 0.320 - 0.340 - 0.360\nB - 0.905 - 0.925 - 0.945\nF#- 0.490 - 0.510 - 0.530\nC#- 0.075 - 0.095 - 0.115\nAb- 0.660 - 0.680 - 0.700\nEb- 0.245 - 0.265 - 0.285\nBb- 0.830 - 0.850 - 0.870\nF - 0.415 - 0.435 - 0.455\n\nUse it to sequence some chords. Duplicate the KNOLY POBS, set them up in a sequence with the SWITCH, TELEPORT and quantize with COERCE.\n\nKNOLY POBS PRESETS:\n\nM13      R  5  3   13  9   7 #11\nM7       R  5  3    7  9  13 #11\nm7       R  5 b3   b7  9  11  13\nDom7     R  5  3   b7  9  13 #11\n5ths     R  5  9   13  3   7 #11",
        "width": 4,
        "screen_colors": 281200098803712,
        "font_choice": "res/fonts/ShareTechMono-Regular.ttf",
        "visible_lines": 28,
        "title_text": "EXPLICAT"
      },
      "pos": [
        2,
        -1
      ]
    },
